1
00:00:00,476 --> 00:00:04,146
(Sheldon:)I should note,
I'm having some digestive distress...

2
00:00:06,065 --> 00:00:10,405
(Sheldon:)...so if I excuse myself abruptly,
don't be alarmed.

3
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:21,241
(Sheldon:)Oh, a napkin.

4
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,170
(Penny:)Turn it over.

5
00:00:30,881 --> 00:00:35,511
"To Sheldon. Live long and prosper.

6
00:00:36,261 --> 00:00:38,891
Leonard Nimoy."

7
00:00:41,517 --> 00:00:45,977
(Penny:)Yeah, he came into the restaurant. Sorry the
napkin's dirty. He wiped his mouth with it.

8
00:00:50,692 --> 00:00:58,022
(Sheldon:)I possess the DNA of Leonard Nimoy?

